Z||000004||gtsonly||08-14-2000||08:40 AM||||hey eric in pa,<BR>   the bourne bridge is one of two bridges giving you access to the wonderful world of the cape. the bourne bridge is the first bridge off of highway 25. if your coming from pa you will probably come east on 195 in massachusetts to 25 south. once on 25 it is all of a 5 minute drive to the bridge. go over the bridge and the i-hop is right there on the left. for all the others, if we want to be there at 8am we are going to have to leave quite early. do we want that ? i can care less either way. we would have to leave at 5 am to be there by 8. if that is cool lets do it. also lets make sure everyone that is going to rally is there so we dont leave anyone. hows the start time?<BR> chris hatch<BR>  1986.5 gt wigth t-tops||||reg||1
Z||000005||Eric_PA||08-14-2000||09:43 AM||||This may sound stupid, but is the bourne bridge in Massachusetts, I do take 95 to that area. I have to check out my map. If I am swinging that way I'll meet there.<P>Eric<BR>86.5 GT||||reg||1
