Z||000017||Mattsfiero||08-16-2000||12:11 AM||||Ok first order...I thought it was 4  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">..lol..And Chris I am not sure you have a GT i imagine. Try this according to the bible the temp. sensor is located off the throttle position sensor...follow the black wire off the throttle position sensor and it should tie into the black wire running off the Temp sensor. (Temp sensor will have a black and yellow wire throttle position sensor has a black, DRk blue, and a grey wire)The sensor is a form of bolt that will tie into the block...not sure where but I hope that may help.<P>Matt||||reg||1
